            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"22-criterio-2-sintomas-recurrentes\">2.2. Criterio 2 (S\u00edntomas recurrentes)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Definici\u00f3n:</strong> COVID confirmado + M\u00e1s de 1 s\u00edntoma recurrente + No recuperado a los 3 meses</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>F\u00f3rmula:</strong> <code>criterio_2 = 1</code> si cumple:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>DP4: COVID confirmado (<code>covid == 1</code>)</li>\n<li>P17: M\u00e1s de 1 s\u00edntoma recurrente (<code>sintoma_recurrente_count &gt; 1</code>)</li>\n<li>P20: No recuperado a los 3 meses (<code>recuperado_3m == 2</code>)</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
